```cpp
template <typename T>
void foo() noexcept(noexcept(T(std::declval<T>()))) {
    // Function body
}
```
Here, `noexcept(T(std::declval<T>()))` uses the `noexcept` operator to query the exception specification of `T`'s move constructor at compile time, and this result then determines `foo`'s `noexcept` specification.
